### Register Customer
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "Nguyen Van Customer",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "phone": "0900000001",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "customer"
}

###

### Register Nurse
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "Nguyen Thi Nurse",
  "email": "nurse@example.com",
  "phone": "0900000002",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "nurse"
}

###

### Login
POST https://localhost:7124/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Get Current User (Protected - requires token)
GET https://localhost:7124/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

